        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "modern-yabejp-ja-chapter03-section026-b2",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section026.html",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0002"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[5]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "这是对[读牌技术论6](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section006.html)、[7](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section007.html)等内容的补充。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "modern-yabejp-ja-chapter03-section026-p3",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section026.html",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0003",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0004",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0005",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0006",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0007",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0008",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0009",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0010",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0011",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0012",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0013",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0014",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0015",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0016",
              "modern-yabejp-ja:chapter03-section026:b0017"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[7]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "在[6](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section006.html)、[7](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section007.html)中提到过，如果按容易构成面子的牌→不易构成面子的牌的顺序手切，往往能提供很有力的信息。除了[6](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section006.html)、[7](http://yabejp.web.fc2.com/mahjong/tactics/chapter03/section007.html)中举出的例子，还有很多场合可以运用这一点。 5m → 9m 按这个顺序打出的话，即使是筋张， 8m 也相当危险；而且， 6p 被杠，或场上已经能看到4张时，却又打出 7p 而进入听牌的话，虽说已经形成了壁， 8p 、 9p 也很可疑。因为，如果听牌时打出的牌并非作为安全牌保留的，该牌附近也不属于因摸入另一张牌而完成面子的那一侧，那么其附近就是所听的牌。",
